        svg: `<line x1="75" y1="220" x2="175" y2="220" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="55" y1="265" x2="150" y2="265" stroke="#0f172a" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>`,
