        voice: "\u00c7ok huzurlu ve \u015firin oldu K\u0131van\u00e7! Tombul Kedi Big ve Froggy bal\u0131k tutmaya haz\u0131r! \u015eimdi onlar\u0131 parlak mor ve yemye\u015fil boyalar\u0131nla renklendir!",
